  "title": "习近平深入甘肃省古浪县农村林场考察调研",
  "date": "2019-08-21 16:59:37",
  "author": "新华社",
  "editor": "(责编：王静                        )",
  "article": "<div class=\"d2txt_con clearfix\">\n<p></p><p style=\"text-indent: 2em;\">\n21日，习近平总书记继续在甘肃考察。上午，习近平来到武威市古浪县黄花滩生态移民区富民新村，了解易地搬迁群众生产生活及脱贫致富情况。随后，他乘车前往八步沙林场，实地察看当地治沙造林、生态保护等情况。（文字记者：张晓松、朱基钗 摄影记者：鞠鹏、谢环驰）</p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2em; text-align: center;\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/NMediaFile/2019/0821/MAIN201908211656000445006988159.jpg\"/></p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2em; text-align: center;\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/NMediaFile/2019/0821/MAIN201908211657000102148921443.jpg\"/></p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2em; text-align: center;\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/NMediaFile/2019/0821/MAIN201908211657000228607204278.jpg\"/></p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2em; text-align: center;\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/NMediaFile/2019/0821/MAIN201908211657000367657719506.jpg\"/></p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2em; text-align: center;\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/NMediaFile/2019/0821/MAIN201908211657000491159190134.jpg\"/></p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2em; text-align: center;\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/NMediaFile/2019/0821/MAIN201908211658000008171971037.jpg\"/></p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2em; text-align: center;\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/NMediaFile/2019/0821/MAIN201908211658000118117170717.jpg\"/></p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2em; text-align: center;\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/NMediaFile/2019/0821/MAIN201908211658000378897926691.jpg\"/></p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2em; text-align: center;\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/NMediaFile/2019/0821/MAIN201908211658000481299018252.jpg\"/></p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2em; text-align: center;\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/NMediaFile/2019/0821/MAIN201908211659000006982492335.jpg\"/></p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2em; text-align: center;\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/NMediaFile/2019/0821/MAIN201908211659000113898315914.jpg\"/></p>\n</div>",
  "text": [
    "21日，习近平总书记继续在甘肃考察。上午，习近平来到武威市古浪县黄花滩生态移民区富民新村，了解易地搬迁群众生产生活及脱贫致富情况。随后，他乘车前往八步沙林场，实地察看当地治沙造林、生态保护等情况。（文字记者：张晓松、朱基钗 摄影记者：鞠鹏、谢环驰）"
